			<p>Thank you for your interest in volunteering with The Salvation Army of Augusta! Whether you're looking to serve as an individual, family, group, or organization, we'd love to help you find the right opportunity. Before creating a volunteer account, please contact our Volunteer Coordinator, Kristin Cordaro, to discuss current volunteer needs and available opportunities.

